MARHAM.pni
Version: 1.0.0
Status: Architecture / Domain Instantiation
Parent Architecture: GENIE / Health GENIE / Triage Cycler
Domain: Health technology
Primary Front Door: Marham
Principle: Orchestrate; do not collapse the underlying systems, modalities, cyclers, models, or human agency.

# 0. PURPOSE

Marham is a health-domain instantiation of the reusable TRIAGE CYCLER pattern.

The Marham architecture provides a front-door health experience while allowing the triage layer to route a heterogeneous health situation into the appropriate health-domain cycler(s).

The architecture is deliberately extensible:

MARHAM
  -> HEALTH TRIAGE CYCLER
  -> HEALTH GENIE
  -> SPECIALIZED HEALTH CYCLER(S)
  -> SYSTEMS / MODELS / MODALITIES / HUMANS
  -> HEALTH REALIZATION

Marham does not need to expose the full Humanesque constitutional architecture to the user.

# 1. CORE ARCHITECTURAL PRINCIPLE

TRIAGE is a general primitive:

TRIAGE = navigation through a heterogeneous configuration space.

A triage cycler identifies:

- what is happening;
- what the person/system needs;
- what information is available;
- what information is missing;
- which domains are implicated;
- which modalities are required;
- which cycler(s) should operate;
- whether cyclers should operate sequentially, concurrently, recursively, or iteratively;
- who or what must make consequential decisions.

For Marham, this primitive is instantiated directly in the health domain.

# 2. MARHAM FRONT-DOOR ARCHITECTURE

MARHAM
  |
  v
HEALTH TRIAGE CYCLER
  |
  v
HEALTH GENIE
  |
  +--> Patient Journey
  +--> Clinician Journey
  +--> System / Operational Journey
  |
  v
Appropriate Health-Domain Cycler(s)
  |
  v
Human Agency + System Execution
  |
  v
Realization

Marham can therefore remain the user-facing/front-door experience while Health GENIE provides the multimodal orchestration intelligence behind increasingly complex workflows.

# 3. HEALTH GENIE

HEALTH GENIE = multimodal meta-cycler for health-domain orchestration.

Health GENIE is invoked because health situations frequently cross:

- domains;
- modalities;
- temporal contexts;
- records;
- operational systems;
- evidence sources;
- specialized cyclers;
- medical models;
- human actors.

Health GENIE determines what needs to participate in a particular health situation and how those participants should be composed.

It does not replace the participating systems.

It composes them.

# 4. HEALTH GENIE IS NOT

Health GENIE is not itself:

- an EMR;
- an EHR;
- an HMIS;
- an LMIS;
- a medical device;
- a drug database;
- a clinical-trial system;
- a medical model;
- a hospital-management system;
- a diagnostic engine;
- a triage classifier.

It is the orchestration layer across them.

# 5. MARHAM TRIAGE FLOW

ARRIVE
  -> ELICIT / OBSERVE
  -> RETRIEVE RELEVANT SUBSTRATE
  -> ASSEMBLE CONTEXT
  -> IDENTIFY INTENT / SITUATION
  -> MAP DOMAINS
  -> MAP MODALITIES
  -> SELECT CYCLER(S)
  -> EXECUTE
  -> RECONCILE
  -> VERIFY
  -> COMPOSE
  -> NEXT STATE / NEXT ACTION

The flow is cyclical rather than a one-shot classification pipeline.

# 6. WHY A HEALTH TRIAGE CYCLER NEEDS HEALTH GENIE

Healthcare is intrinsically heterogeneous.

A single patient journey may involve:

- natural-language conversation;
- speech;
- structured demographics;
- symptoms;
- clinical notes;
- diagnoses;
- medications;
- prescriptions;
- laboratory results;
- pathology;
- radiology;
- medical images;
- physiological waveforms;
- device telemetry;
- procedures;
- longitudinal EMR/EHR history;
- HMIS data;
- LMIS / logistics data;
- medical-device data;
- drug information;
- operational workflows;
- clinical guidelines;
- medical literature;
- clinical-trial protocols;
- predictive / diagnostic models;
- clinicians;
- institutions.

A conventional router tends toward:

INPUT -> CLASSIFY -> ONE DESTINATION

Health GENIE supports:

INPUT
  -> INTERPRET CONFIGURATION
  -> DECOMPOSE
  -> IDENTIFY MODALITIES
  -> IDENTIFY DOMAINS
  -> SELECT CYCLERS
  -> PARALLEL / SEQUENTIAL / RECURSIVE EXECUTION
  -> RECONCILE
  -> VERIFY
  -> COMPOSE
  -> NEXT STATE

# 7. DOMAIN / MODALITY / CYCLER DISTINCTION

DOMAIN = what kind of health reality is involved?

Examples:

- clinical;
- pharmaceutical;
- diagnostic;
- operational;
- epidemiological;
- research;
- logistics;
- public-health;
- administrative.

MODALITY = in what form does relevant information exist?

Examples:

- text;
- speech;
- image;
- video;
- waveform;
- structured record;
- tabular data;
- sensor stream;
- molecular data;
- document;
- database;
- human observation.

CYCLER = what operation needs to happen?

Examples:

- retrieve;
- interpret;
- diagnose / support diagnosis;
- monitor;
- reconcile;
- schedule;
- coordinate;
- verify;
- learn;
- execute;
- escalate;
- document.

GENIE = how must heterogeneous domains, modalities, systems, cyclers, evidence and humans be composed into a coherent operation?

# 8. HEALTH-TECH ESTATE

HEALTH GENIE can orchestrate an entire health-technology ecosystem.

Major participating systems include:

CARE
- EMR
- EHR
- clinical systems
- pharmacy
- imaging
- laboratories

DATA / INFRASTRUCTURE
- HMIS
- LMIS
- devices
- telemetry
- longitudinal records

RESEARCH
- clinical trials
- evidence
- protocols
- cohorts
- medical literature

PHARMACEUTICAL
- drugs
- medication knowledge
- interactions
- prescribing systems

OPERATIONS
- hospitals
- clinics
- pharmacies
- laboratories
- supply chains
- scheduling
- resource management

MODELS
- diagnostic models
- imaging models
- laboratory interpretation models
- medication interaction models
- predictive models
- other medical models

# 9. SPECIALIZED CYCLERS

Health GENIE may invoke multiple specialized cyclers.

Examples:

- clinical cycler;
- patient triage cycler;
- imaging cycler;
- laboratory cycler;
- medication cycler;
- pharmacy cycler;
- device-monitoring cycler;
- clinical-trial cycler;
- evidence-retrieval cycler;
- hospital operations cycler;
- scheduling cycler;
- logistics / supply cycler;
- documentation cycler;
- care-coordination cycler;
- public-health cycler;
- model-evaluation cycler.

Cyclers may operate:

- sequentially;
- concurrently;
- recursively;
- iteratively;
- conditionally.

Their outputs can be reconciled and composed by Health GENIE.

# 10. MEDICAL MODELS

A medical model is a participant, not the architecture.

Health GENIE may:

- retrieve patient context;
- invoke an imaging model;
- invoke a laboratory interpretation model;
- invoke a medication interaction model;
- retrieve authoritative evidence;
- invoke a clinician;
- reconcile outputs;
- preserve provenance;
- determine the next cycler.

A model must not silently become the health system.

Model-derived inference remains distinguishable from:

- authoritative records;
- retrieved evidence;
- device observations;
- human observations;
- clinician judgment;
- operational state.

# 11. MULTIMODAL COMPOSITION

A single health journey may traverse:

VOICE
  -> TEXT
  -> SYMPTOMS
  -> STRUCTURED DATA
  -> LONGITUDINAL EHR
  -> LABS
  -> IMAGE
  -> DEVICE WAVEFORM
  -> DRUG KNOWLEDGE
  -> CLINICAL EVIDENCE
  -> CLINICIAN
  -> OPERATIONS
  -> OUTCOME

No single modality-native cycler should be required to own the entire walk.

Health GENIE is the cross-modal composition layer.

It preserves relationships among modalities without pretending that the modalities are equivalent.

# 12. COMPOSITIONAL TRIAGE

Without GENIE:

INPUT
  -> CLASSIFY
  -> ONE DESTINATION

With GENIE:

INPUT
  -> INTERPRET CONFIGURATION
  -> DECOMPOSE
  -> IDENTIFY DOMAINS
  -> IDENTIFY MODALITIES
  -> SELECT CYCLERS
  -> PARALLEL / SEQUENTIAL EXECUTION
  -> RECONCILE
  -> VERIFY
  -> COMPOSE
  -> NEXT STATE

GENIE may invoke another GENIE when the problem crosses architectural boundaries.

Example:

Health GENIE
  -> Clinical GENIE
       -> Imaging Cycler

while simultaneously:

Health GENIE
  -> Medication Cycler

Health GENIE
  -> Operational Cycler

Health GENIE
  -> Clinical-Trial Cycler

Outputs are subsequently reconciled and recombined.

# 13. GENIE ESCALATION / DESCENT

The general GENIE architecture applies directly:

CYCLER
  -> GENIE ELEVATION
  -> META-ORCHESTRATION
  -> CYCLER DESCENT

Health GENIE may:

- invoke multiple cyclers;
- invoke multiple specialized GENIEs;
- split into concurrent orchestration branches;
- merge outputs;
- recurse when the configuration changes;
- elevate to a higher-order GENIE when cross-domain composition requires it.

Thus Health GENIE is a domain instantiation of the existing GENIE meta-cycler architecture, not a separate conceptual mechanism.

# 14. REUSABLE TRIAGE PRIMITIVE

The triage cycler should remain domain-neutral at its primitive layer.

The reusable pattern is:

TRIAGE CYCLER
  -> identify intent / situation / destination
  -> retrieve relevant substrate
  -> route to appropriate domainal cycler(s)
  -> compose where necessary
  -> return to user/system
  -> observe next state
  -> cycle

Humanesque instantiation:

HUMANESQUE
  -> CHARBAGH
  -> FAKIR / GENIE
  -> ESTATE / CYCLER
  -> REALIZATION

Healthcare instantiation:

HEALTH ECOSYSTEM
  -> HEALTH TRIAGE CYCLER
  -> HEALTH GENIE
  -> SPECIALIZED HEALTH CYCLER(S)
  -> REALIZATION

# 15. MARHAM'S POSITION

Marham is the front-door health experience.

The triage architecture can be adapted directly to Marham without requiring the user to understand the entire Health GENIE architecture.

At increasing complexity, the front door remains stable while orchestration expands behind it.

MARHAM
  -> TRIAGE
  -> HEALTH GENIE
  -> specialized orchestration
  -> health systems / models / humans
  -> realization

# 16. HEALTH GENIE AS META-CYCLER

A cycler operates within a configuration space.

A GENIE operates when the configuration space becomes:

- heterogeneous;
- composite;
- multimodal;
- recursive;
- cross-cycler;
- cross-system;
- cross-domain.

Therefore:

SIMPLE CONFIGURATION
  -> CYCLER

COMPOSITE CONFIGURATION
  -> GENIE

COMPOSITE GENIE CONFIGURATION
  -> META-GENIE / HIGHER-ORDER GENIE

This is the architectural reason Health GENIE is required.

# 17. HUMAN AGENCY

Health GENIE orchestrates; it does not erase consequential human agency.

The architecture distinguishes:

- patient;
- clinician;
- care team;
- institution;
- operational actors;
- medical models;
- authoritative systems;
- evidence sources.

Where a consequential decision requires human authority, the orchestration layer must route to the appropriate human actor rather than silently substituting model output.

# 18. PROVENANCE / EVIDENCE / GOVERNANCE

Because health information is heterogeneous and consequential, Health GENIE must preserve:

- provenance;
- source identity;
- temporal context;
- modality;
- evidence status;
- model status;
- uncertainty;
- transformations;
- reconciliation history;
- human decisions;
- system actions.

Retrieved material, model inference, human observation and generated synthesis must remain distinguishable.

# 19. BACKEND NEUTRALITY

Health GENIE is backend-neutral.

It should not require a single:

- EMR vendor;
- EHR vendor;
- HMIS;
- LMIS;
- device manufacturer;
- imaging stack;
- laboratory system;
- drug database;
- clinical-trial platform;
- medical-model provider.

Heterogeneous infrastructure remains underneath the orchestration layer.

# 20. MODALITY PRESERVATION

During composition, preserve:

- modality semantics;
- source provenance;
- temporal ordering;
- identity and context;
- uncertainty;
- state;
- authorization;
- clinical significance.

Composition must not flatten unlike observations into an undifferentiated representation.

# 21. GENERALIZATION

The same triage + GENIE pattern can extend beyond healthcare.

TRIAGE CYCLER
  -> domain-specific GENIE
  -> specialized cyclers
  -> systems / models / modalities / humans
  -> realization

Possible domains include:

- Humanesque;
- healthcare;
- education;
- finance;
- public administration;
- research;
- industrial operations;
- other heterogeneous ecosystems.

The domain-specific GENIE supplies the appropriate domain ontology, systems, governance and cycler substrate while retaining the general meta-cycler architecture.

# 22. CORE FORMULA

MARHAM
  -> HEALTH TRIAGE CYCLER
  -> HEALTH GENIE
  -> DOMAIN / MODALITY MAP
  -> SPECIALIZED CYCLER(S)
  -> SYSTEMS / MODELS / HUMANS
  -> RECONCILIATION
  -> VERIFICATION
  -> REALIZATION
  -> NEXT STATE

# 23. CONSTITUTIONAL BOUNDARIES

Marham / Triage Cycler:
- identifies and navigates the health situation.

Health GENIE:
- composes heterogeneous health-domain participation.

Specialized Cyclers:
- perform domain-specific operations.

FAKIR-like retrieval infrastructure where applicable:
- retrieves authoritative substrate rather than inventing it.

Medical Models:
- provide model-derived inference as bounded participants.

Authoritative Systems:
- provide records and operational state.

Humans:
- retain consequential agency where required.

# 24. DESIGN AXIOMS

1. TRIAGE IS NAVIGATION, NOT MERELY CLASSIFICATION.
2. HEALTHCARE TRIAGE MUST HANDLE HETEROGENEITY.
3. GENIE IS THE COMPOSITION LAYER FOR HETEROGENEOUS CONFIGURATIONS.
4. MODALITIES MUST REMAIN DISTINGUISHABLE.
5. DOMAINS MUST REMAIN DISTINGUISHABLE.
6. SPECIALIZED CYCLERS SHOULD RETAIN THEIR OWN SEMANTICS.
7. MEDICAL MODELS ARE PARTICIPANTS, NOT THE ARCHITECTURE.
8. AUTHORITATIVE RECORDS AND MODEL INFERENCE MUST REMAIN DISTINCT.
9. HUMAN CONSEQUENTIAL AGENCY MUST BE PRESERVED.
10. PROVENANCE MUST SURVIVE COMPOSITION.
11. BACKEND IMPLEMENTATIONS MUST REMAIN INTEROPERABLE AND REPLACEABLE.
12. GENIE MAY ELEVATE, SPLIT, COMPOSE, MERGE, RECURSE AND DESCEND.
13. THE FRONT DOOR MAY REMAIN SIMPLE WHILE THE BACKEND ORCHESTRATION IS COMPLEX.
14. THE ARCHITECTURE MUST SUPPORT THE NEXT STATE, NOT ONLY THE CURRENT CLASSIFICATION.
15. MARHAM IS AN INSTANTIATION OF THE PATTERN, NOT THE LIMIT OF THE PATTERN.

# 25. CANONICAL HIERARCHY

GENIE
  -> HEALTH GENIE
      -> HEALTH TRIAGE CYCLER
          -> SPECIALIZED HEALTH CYCLERS
              -> EMR / EHR / HMIS / LMIS / DEVICES
              -> DRUGS / TRIALS / IMAGING / LABS
              -> MEDICAL MODELS
              -> CLINICIANS / PATIENTS / CARE TEAMS / INSTITUTIONS
          -> RECONCILIATION / VERIFICATION
      -> HEALTH REALIZATION

MARHAM is the direct front-door instantiation of the Health Triage layer.

# 26. SHORT DEFINITION

MARHAM:
A health-domain front door implementing the reusable Triage Cycler pattern.

HEALTH TRIAGE CYCLER:
A cyclical navigator through heterogeneous health situations, domains, modalities, and destinations.

HEALTH GENIE:
The multimodal meta-cycler that composes the specialized cyclers, systems, models, evidence and humans required by a health situation.

Together:

MARHAM provides the front door.
TRIAGE provides navigation.
HEALTH GENIE provides composition.
SPECIALIZED CYCLERS provide execution.
SYSTEMS / MODELS / HUMANS provide domain capabilities.
RECONCILIATION + VERIFICATION preserve coherence.
REALIZATION produces the next health state/action.
